&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1j4zddb&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who we are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab ® is a global leader in IoT and connected transportation and certified “Great Place to Work™.” We are a company of diverse and talented individuals who work together to help businesses grow and succeed, and increase the safety and sustainability of our communities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab is advancing security, connecting commercial vehicles to the internet and providing web-based analytics to help customers better manage their fleets. Geotab’s open platform and Geotab Marketplace ®, offering hundreds of third-party solution options, allows both small and large businesses to automate operations by integrating vehicle data with their other data assets. Processing billions of data points a day, Geotab leverages data analytics and machine learning to improve productivity, optimize fleets through the reduction of fuel consumption, enhance driver safety and achieve strong compliance to regulatory changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Our team is growing and we’re looking for people who follow their passion, think differently and want to make an impact. Ours is a fast paced, ever changing environment. Geotabbers accept that challenge and are willing to take on new tasks and activities - ones that may not always be described in the initial job description. Join us for a fulfilling career with opportunities to innovate, great benefits, and our fun and inclusive work culture. Reach your full potential with Geotab. To see what it’s like to be a Geotabber, check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover css-sbvzk&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.geotab.com/blog/&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and follow us @InsideGeotab on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover css-sbvzk&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidegeotab/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who you are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-87&quot;&gt;We are always looking for amazing talent who can contribute to our growth and deliver results! Geotab is seeking a Product Analyst (Product, Business, and Data) who will cover the full product, business, and data spectrum for GVP, owning the numbers behind the platform including metrics, queries, dashboards, and data architecture to drive decisions the team acts on. If you love technology, and are keen to join an industry leader — we would love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-83&quot;&gt;As a Product Analyst (Product, Business, and Data) your key area of responsibility will be defining, instrumenting, tracking, and analyzing key product and business metrics, building queries, pipelines, dashboards, and maintaining data architecture to steer the product and business. You will need to work closely with senior product and engineering leaders, product management, service teams, and leadership. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-83&quot;&gt;To be successful in this role you will be a self-starter who requires little training or onboarding, finds the questions worth answering, and possesses clear written and verbal communication skills. In addition, the successful candidate will have a proven record of shipped analyses, models, or data products that reached real decisions, strong SQL and Python/R proficiency, hands-on experience with data modeling and data warehouse architecture, and fluency with BI tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;How you&#39;ll make an impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Define, instrument, track, and analyze key product and business metrics for the GVP platform, including adoption, engagement, retention, and revenue indicators, and share insights with the product team and leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Write and maintain the metrics queries and reporting pipelines the team relies on for daily, weekly, and quarterly reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Run deep dive analyses on product usage, funnels, pricing, and operational questions, and present clear, defensible recommendations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Design, document, and maintain the data architecture and data housing that analytics depends on, including schemas, data models, and table structures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Support the service team backend with data architecture and data housing analysis, and help resolve data structure, quality, and consistency issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Build and maintain dashboards that leadership, product, and service teams actually use to steer the product and the business, and keep them accurate and current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Develop systems and processes for qualitative and quantitative evidence collection, fostering a data informed culture across the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Partner with product management to size opportunities, define success metrics for new features, evaluate results after launch, track metric targets, and document data definitions and logic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A record of shipped analyses, models, or data products that reached real decisions or real users.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong SQL plus working proficiency in Python or R.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Fluency with at least one BI tool such as Looker, Tableau, or Power BI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Hands on experience with data modelling and data warehouse or data architecture work (BigQuery or similar cloud warehouse experience is a plus).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proven range across product analysis, business analysis, and data analysis, often within the same week.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Clear written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A self starter who requires little training or onboarding, finds the questions worth answering, and answers them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Comfortable with a high intensity workload and based in, or willing to relocate to, Dubai for onsite work at the Geotab office in Dubai Internet City.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;If you got this far, we hope you&#39;re feeling excited about this role! Even if you don&#39;t feel you meet every single requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note: Geotab does not accept agency resumes and is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes. Please do not forward resumes to Geotab employees.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1j4zddb&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;How we work:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;The health and safety of employees are a top priority. We encourage work-life balance and keep the Geotab culture going strong with online social events, chat rooms and gatherings. Join us and help reshape the future of technology!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;We believe that ensuring diversity is fundamental to our future growth and progress and is an integral part of our business. We believe that success happens where new ideas can flourish – in an environment that is rich in diversity and a place where people from various backgrounds can work together. Geotab encourages applications from all qualified individuals.&amp;nbsp; We are committed to accommodating people with disabilities during the recruitment and assessment processes and when people are hired. We will ensure the accessibility needs of employees with disabilities are taken into account as part of performance management, career development, training and redeployment processes. If you require accommodation at any stage of the application process or want more information about our diversity and inclusion as well as accommodation policies and practices, please contact us at careers@geotab.com. By submitting a job application to Geotab Inc. or its affiliates and subsidiaries (collectively, “Geotab”), you acknowledge Geotab’s collection, use and disclosure of your personal data in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.geotab.com/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uE3uV2SSp0YnYx4utU9QdhN8Q_RzqMphI_pVJyVWQn8/edit?tab=t.0&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to read our Privacy Notice.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
